 "poem": "And May is all sweet the today,\nPleasure of my days away,\nA merry day on green grass away.\nThese things we do with birthday\nAnd me for other day, day by celebration,\nThat night is now day and then next Sunday,\nThe night that's so bright in her eyes away.\nHere she stands beside the wheel-house cafe,\nAnd he's home at the door away.\nO thing that's come from birthday\nFor others to be their supper celebration,\nFor his day at mine destination,",
